        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac{5}{3}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2^{2x}&=2^{5(x+1)}\\\\2x&=5x+5\\\\-3x&=5\\\\x&=-\\frac{5}{3}\\end{align*}$$",
